  "  In animate(): camera.position.set(Math.sin(ry)*Math.cos(rx)*zoom+panX,Math.sin(rx)*zoom+panY,Math.cos(ry)*Math.cos(rx)*zoom); camera.lookAt(panX,panY,0);",
